{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55728","headline":"临示寂声钟集衆说偈 · 普闻","name":"临示寂声钟集衆说偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我逃世难来出家，宗师指示个歇处。\n住山聚衆三十年，寻常不欲轻分付。\n今日分明说似君，我歛目时齐听取。\n（见《五灯会元》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"普闻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}